     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi folks,</div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;ve made a few minor updates, if you get one of these errors:</div><div><br></div><div>===========</div><div>Error in tipranges_to_tip_condlikes_of_data_on_each_state(tipranges, phy,  : </div>\r\n<div>  unused argument (useAmbiguities = BioGeoBEARS_run_object$useAmbiguities)</div><div><br></div><div>or:</div><div><br></div><div>Error in check_BioGeoBEARS_run(BioGeoBEARS_run_object) : </div><div>  could not find function &quot;geogtaxa&quot;</div>\r\n<div>===========</div><div><br></div><div>...it means you need to use the new source() commands in the example script:</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeobears#toc14\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeobears%23toc14&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485627371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0XHu68Cd34xcksaAxfi4wG\">http://phylo.wikidot.com/biogeobears#toc14</a></div>\r\n<div>========</div><div>library(BioGeoBEARS)</div><div>source(&quot;<a href=\"http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_basics_v1.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_basics_v1.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485627371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3goMgjVctmfLzqG3N2UrAv\">http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_basics_v1.R</a>&quot;)</div>\r\n<div>source(&quot;<a href=\"http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_classes_v1.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_classes_v1.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485627371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0pZS7sO2sbIX7ZUcPP8S24\">http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_classes_v1.R</a>&quot;)</div><div>source(&quot;<a href=\"http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_stratified_v1.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_stratified_v1.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485627371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3ZdQrhsoXBtnTgGoOjjuPB\">http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_stratified_v1.R</a>&quot;)</div>\r\n<div>source(&quot;<a href=\"http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_models_v1.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_models_v1.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485627371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw38KO7u-wjOVXT4zFZcMzG2\">http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_models_v1.R</a>&quot;)</div><div>source(&quot;<a href=\"http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_univ_model_v1.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_univ_model_v1.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485627371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1wiDDzsP43pETSqbNCnKVZ\">http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_univ_model_v1.R</a>&quot;)</div>\r\n<div>source(&quot;<a href=\"http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_plots_v1.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_plots_v1.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485627371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw026D3OVIYex3LBRF7hgL7M\">http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_plots_v1.R</a>&quot;)</div><div>source(&quot;<a href=\"http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_readwrite_v1.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_readwrite_v1.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485627371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1FIrzSDosil_rrH7BwxyT5\">http://phylo.wdfiles.com/local--files/biogeobears/BioGeoBEARS_readwrite_v1.R</a>&quot;)</div>\r\n<div>source(&quot;<a href=\"http://phylo.wikidot.com/local--files/biogeobears/calc_loglike_sp_v01.R\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://phylo.wikidot.com/local--files/biogeobears/calc_loglike_sp_v01.R&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792485627371000&amp;usg=AOvVaw24OZhz4TnYTTYXlXAvKZpY\">http://phylo.wikidot.com/local--files/biogeobears/calc_loglike_sp_v01.R</a>&quot;)</div><div>calc_loglike_sp = compiler::cmpfun(calc_loglike_sp_prebyte)    # crucial to fix bug in uppass calculations</div>\r\n<div>========</div><div><br></div><div>...I&#39;ve added another file or two since the last version of the example script, if their updates aren&#39;t sourced, you&#39;ll get those errors.</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers!</div>\r\n<div>Nick</div><div><br></div></div>\r\n"
